5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I hate walking past the corner in August. It smells terrible. What are we actually going to do about it?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree, Rin. It’s unpleasant for everyone. Before we pick a fix, can we look at what this corner actually costs us each year?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Fair point, Midori. But I’m more worried about us still being able to talk to each other after this. Let’s keep that in mind.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"I’m all for harmony, but I need to know the actual time cost. Who is going to be stuck doing the heavy lifting here?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Asuka: I want to know who has been suffering the most. If one household has been stuck with this at their gate for years, we can’t just pretend it’s equal.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, that sounds really unfair. I hope we can find a way to share the burden so nobody feels stuck there alone.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Asuka, that’s a valid concern. Let’s make sure the final plan doesn’t just shift the problem to someone else’s doorstep.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, the time cost is real, but so is the social one. If we pick a plan that makes us avoid each other, we’ve lost. Let’s look at the complaint log to see who’s been hit hardest.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, the log tells us who complained, not who did the work. I need to know the actual hours involved. Let’s check the supervised mornings on the next lane.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, the log shows who complained, not who suffered. I want the measurements of the five frontages to see who actually has space.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@May, I want to see what the station block’s bin house is like. I don’t want to just swap one smell for another!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Midori, I’m looking into the block ledger of refuse-point expenses and the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shunichi, I’m checking the ward complaint log for this point and the statements at the residents' meeting.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"@May, I’m checking the supervised mornings on the next lane and the truck arrival time from the crew leader.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Asuka, I’m checking the measurements of the five frontages and the ward filing requirements per the installations clerk.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,"@Rin, I’m checking the visit to the station block's bin house and the station block's meeting minutes.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,I’m checking the block ledger of refuse-point expenses and the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Midori: I’m checking the block ledger of refuse-point expenses and the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs.""}]}"
